{
  "_createdAt": "2026-04-27T21:50:13Z",
  "_id": "wp-post-1460-en",
  "_rev": "dJ4ZpMyfIFtQ0D7lyxhgOV",
  "_type": "article",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-07-05T16:14:38Z",
  "author": {
    "_ref": "author-legacy-archive",
    "_type": "reference"
  },
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "000000000001",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000000",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A luxurious Egypt trip isn't only about lavish hotels. Good hotels, comfortable cars, fine boats, and quiet restaurants greatly help the trip. What really has value in Egypt is time use, judgment avoiding crowds, excellent guides, and margin to understand sites without rushing."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000003",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3h3uzx7ww15y",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Seeing the pyramids early morning. Walking the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "sqqu96gqrrl5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "pw4pljx197l0"
          ],
          "text": "Valley of the Kings"
        },
        {
          "_key": "alkci3knek6x",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " with a guide who can properly read the wall paintings. Not packing the schedule and watching evening light on the Nile. Using a day in "
        },
        {
          "_key": "t8t1r1a2nlbn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "f9ejzf8x5i3u"
          ],
          "text": "Aswan"
        },
        {
          "_key": "xtypxdj1e7cs",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " unhurried. Such experiences are the essence of Egyptian luxury."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "pw4pljx197l0",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.valley-of-the-kings",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "f9ejzf8x5i3u",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58758",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000005",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000004",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This guide isn't a list of hotels or famous brands — it organises where investment improves the trip. Accommodation, ship, flight, opening status, and prices change; before specific booking, confirm latest information."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000007",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What luxury means in Egypt"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000009",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In Egypt, luxury involves both \"convenience\" and \"depth.\" Heat, transfer distance, traffic, site crowding, ticket conditions, regional safety information — many things complicate travel. Good arrangements reduce them."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "hqs1yf8gzmxl",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A private car eases movement in "
        },
        {
          "_key": "uvmhe431xwpi",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "5iindzkyynmq"
          ],
          "text": "Cairo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "grqlwyby61zx",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "_key": "wgezfo5dh0gk",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "vv011q3nchpr"
          ],
          "text": "Luxor"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e0xokmy7ps3w",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". An experienced guide makes sites more than photo backdrops. Choosing a quality Nile cruise or dahabiya makes on-board time the trip's centre."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "5iindzkyynmq",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "vv011q3nchpr",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58877",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Flashy staging or only-expensive arrangements don't necessarily make a good trip. In Egypt, beyond which hotel you stay in, at which time you go where, with whom you visit, and where you rest matter."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0lr5ttsn401k",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cairo and "
        },
        {
          "_key": "dx4s28iefqw7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "uvl65dzt6g05"
          ],
          "text": "Giza"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "uvl65dzt6g05",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000011",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "u65mqgb21tr5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Even on a luxurious Egypt trip, Cairo is unavoidable. The Grand Egyptian Museum, Giza pyramids, Saqqara, Islamic Cairo, and "
        },
        {
          "_key": "crp8tk0q9omv",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "254x3bg9yhh6"
          ],
          "text": "Coptic Cairo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ljks6vd1894m",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " each open a different era."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "254x3bg9yhh6",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-63606",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000013",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Quality Cairo travel begins by not over-packing. Cramming Giza pyramids, GEM, and Saqqara into one day thins all. Pyramids and museum alone make a dense day."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000015",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For lodging, choose by whether you weigh pyramid view, Nile-side convenience, or old-city access. Beyond hotel name, transfer time, room orientation, ease of morning departure, and concierge or car arrangement strength matter more practically."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000017",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How to fit in the GEM"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000019",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The GEM is worth allocating time even on luxury trips. Tutankhamun Galleries, major display halls, Grand Staircase, and Khufu's boat — many sights, unsuited to brief rushes."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For deep museum visits, allocate half a day with a guide who can read ancient-Egyptian flow. Same day with the pyramids is possible; both seriously is a full day."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before visiting, confirm ticket, hours, entry conditions, photo rules, and display range on the official site. Museum information changes; don't rely only on unofficial sites or old travelogues."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Luxor"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000021",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Luxor is where investment shows most clearly in luxury Egypt travel. The reason is clear. Many things to see, deep content, and experience changes greatly by guide quality."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000023",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8m4f89yztl73",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Karnak, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "1qyenjowicup",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "fowr8s4yhovu"
          ],
          "text": "Luxor Temple"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ft5ppufqstt6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "xr2nd3vgqtfh",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "2rcnmiefymrj"
          ],
          "text": "Medinet Habu"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5bgwoxv7a9e6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k4tfwib31j6g",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "a3s9ed3ujftd"
          ],
          "text": "Deir el-Medina"
        },
        {
          "_key": "iy9qjl1kz3fw",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", nobles' tombs. Touring them briefly mixes impressions."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "fowr8s4yhovu",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.the-luxor-temple",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "2rcnmiefymrj",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.madinat-habu-temple",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "a3s9ed3ujftd",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.deir-el-madina",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000025",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000024",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In Luxor, invest in an excellent Egyptology guide. Valley of the Kings wall paintings aren't decoration but religious imagery showing afterworld, the sun's night journey, and royal rebirth. Listening while seeing changes tomb meaning."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000027",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Early starts and midday rest matter. In hot season especially, morning west bank, afternoon rest at hotel or Nile-side, evening Luxor Temple or light walk makes the trip richer."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000029",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How to travel the Nile"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In luxury Egypt travel, handling Nile movement matters. Fly Luxor to Aswan, move by private car, board motor cruise, or proceed slowly by dahabiya. All can be right; experience differs greatly."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Large quality cruise ships suit comfort, food, and stable-schedule lovers. Transfer and lodging combined; less luggage shuffling."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Dahabiyas suit those wanting quieter, small-group experience. Boats vary; Nile wind, riverbank villages, evening mooring, time away from busy landings draw appeal."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000031",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000030",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Either way, beyond ship name, confirm actual itinerary, port-stop time, guide, food, cabin, tip handling, and cancellation conditions. On the Nile, schedule shape sets the trip more than ship luxury."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000033",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6j620px0ns92",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Aswan and "
        },
        {
          "_key": "0a9ave0jc34f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "2xzt5jcz08p7"
          ],
          "text": "Abu Simbel"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "2xzt5jcz08p7",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-56813",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000035",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000034",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Aswan has a pace different from Cairo or Luxor. Wide Nile, islands, granite rocks, and Nubian-culture air. On a luxury trip, easing the schedule a little here matters."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000037",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000036",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Philae, Nubian Museum, Elephantine, Unfinished Obelisk, and evening river outing deserve unhurried seeing. Staying at a luxury hotel, don't finish in room or restaurant — make time to feel Aswan's light and river."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000039",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000038",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Abu Simbel uses stamina even on quality itineraries. Often early start with transfer distance. Private car, flight, or Lake Nasser cruise — way of going changes experience."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The luxury choice isn't simply the priciest way — it is arranging arrival time. Confirm arrangements avoiding crowds and heat with enough time at the temples."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Resting on the Red Sea"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "482on00ht618",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egypt trips lean to sites; combining the Red Sea changes trip rhythm. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "objg2hkm982k",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "3qsyep9s9sfb"
          ],
          "text": "Hurghada"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7xr14a6mwooe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "a44qpqjt03bp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "rw0yazgkv67b"
          ],
          "text": "El Gouna"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gqt21mrnqbnp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "uh0ddzgkgh1b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "4kyyrnfjei9c"
          ],
          "text": "Marsa Alam"
        },
        {
          "_key": "wqubc74we25o",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", and Sharm el-Sheikh suit travellers with beach, diving, and resort stay as purpose."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "3qsyep9s9sfb",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "rw0yazgkv67b",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58740",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "4kyyrnfjei9c",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58885",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000041",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000040",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Red Sea luxury differs completely from ancient sites. Coral reefs, high-visibility sea, boats, quiet resorts, and dive safety management are central. For diving, beyond resort appearance, weigh dive-centre safety standards, guide, equipment, and sea-state judgment."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000043",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000042",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Forcing the Red Sea into short itineraries increases transfer. For sites-deep trips, the Red Sea fits another trip too. Including it, at least 2 nights makes it meaningful as rest."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000045",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000044",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Where to spend money"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000047",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000046",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The most value-producing investments in luxury Egypt travel are excellent guides, private car, schedule with time margin, and quality Nile boats."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000049",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000048",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Hotels matter; spending all budget on hotels can thin site experience. In Luxor and Cairo especially, guide and transfer quality greatly set day satisfaction."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Early starts, crowd avoidance, break time, and food-place choice are modest but important. In Egypt, daytime heat and traffic lower trip quality; buying time becomes the real luxury."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What to confirm before booking"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before booking luxury hotels, cruises, or private tours, beyond price, confirm what is included. Airport transfer, site entries, guide, car, food, tips, domestic flights, and cancellation conditions — actual experience and total differ greatly."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000051",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000050",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For hotels, confirm room view, refurbishment status, construction presence, and transit access. \"Nile-side,\" \"pyramid view,\" \"historic building\" descriptions appeal; per-room experience can differ."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000053",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000052",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For cruises, confirm ship name, cabin count, actual departure, port stops, guide language, on-board food, dress code, and extra fees. For dahabiyas, schedules can shift with wind, water level, and operating conditions."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000055",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000054",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before travel, confirm your government's latest travel information, Egypt entry conditions, visa, and health information. Safety and entry conditions change; don't base on old articles."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000057",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000056",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Common failures"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000059",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000058",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A common failure is making hotels lavish and packing the itinerary. With morning to night of transfer and sightseeing, returning to a good hotel, no time to savour the stay."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Another is trying to include all famous places. Packing Cairo, Giza, Saqqara, Luxor, Aswan, Abu Simbel, and Red Sea in a short period makes transfer the trip's lead."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Undervaluing the guide is also a failure. In Egypt, guide quality greatly changes site understanding. To not end as a photo-only trip, guide choice deserves budget and time."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Thinking about quality itineraries"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000061",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000060",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For first luxury Egypt, 3 days Cairo-Giza, 3 days Luxor, 3 days Aswan-Abu Simbel, and 2 to 4 days Nile or Red Sea is a stable thinking."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000063",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000062",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For short trips, narrow to Cairo, Giza, and Luxor. 10 or more days makes Aswan-Abu Simbel, Nile cruise, and Red Sea easier to combine."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000065",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000064",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What matters is separating \"seeing time\" and \"digesting time\" at each place. After seeing sites, hold the aftertaste on the hotel terrace or boat. After morning sightseeing, rest at midday. See the Nile in evening light. This margin turns luxury Egypt travel from expensive into deep."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000067",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000066",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "To see Egypt in the best form"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000069",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000068",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egypt gives sights to rushed people too. Those who prepare well, choose good times, walk with trusted people, and have time to rest see a completely different face."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Luxury isn't matching everything to your convenience. Rather, in Egypt, building the trip to match the land's time, heat, light, river, and site density."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Stay at good hotels, board good ships, walk with good guides. Beyond that, value quiet morning pyramids, evening Nile, and a few minutes before a royal tomb where no one rushes you. There lies quality only Egypt provides."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
